{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/Logo.png?t=1751421316\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Swamp Keeper is a Korean-style bow action arena shooter inspired by one-shot, one-kill gameplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are the &quot;Swamp Keeper,&quot; defender of the sacred swamp, armed with only a bow to repel invading enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the art of archery, defeat waves of foes, and take down their commander.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/01.gif?t=1751421316\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ho\u2019s forces have invaded the sacred swamp, targeting its precious resources!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wielding iron and fire, the enemy has already reached the heart of the swamp shrine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the sworn guardian of these wetlands, it\u2019s your duty to drive them out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/02.gif?t=1751421316\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With support from your allies, traverse the battlefield and restore peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/03.gif?t=1751421316\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pull, aim, release \u2014 experience the high-stakes tension of one-shot, one-kill charging bow action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/04.gif?t=1751421316\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft arrows that suit your style, select your skills, and prepare for combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/05.gif?t=1751421316\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy charming Korean-style anthropomorphic characters and beautifully rendered backgrounds.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3689390?t=1751421316","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/b82b27aea91dbdf4d35d529b028c662664c6a244/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751421316","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/b5162e391680ec2ab23eedf10d438dc0d8a0d387/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751421316","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/b5162e391680ec2ab23eedf10d438dc0d8a0d387/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751421316","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3799650,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689390/extras/Logo.png?t=1751421316\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Swamp Keeper is a Korean-style bow action arena shooter inspired by one-shot, one-kill gameplay. </p><p c